{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼本日の写メどーん♪／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/26/2992181/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の若月ブログは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月的なあるあるネタ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の中で書いているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車ネタが多いですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お許しを(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月あるある、共感して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頂けるかしら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『わかるわぁーっ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『それなぁーっ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃんじゃん声に出して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでください(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼電車の中で自分の場所だけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直で冷房が当たり凄く寒い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗[ぇ？ちょ、車掌さぁん？寒いよぉ?(笑)]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼マネキンが着ていた服をいざ試着してみるとイメージと違った。┗[あれ？なんかもっとこう...。マネキンのスタイル良すぎ涙目]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼サルエルの良さがわからない(若月はサルエル好きですが。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┗[なんだか足がハムスター並みに短いよ。って言われた。]"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▼時間が無くて洗濯機でおまかせ乾燥までするとTシャツが可哀想なことになる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph",